# A pass reads its catalog listing before it checks the one-pass guard, as
# the #5357 fix first did (#5412). A pass that waited out another then plans
# from a listing that still holds rows the other pass pruned, and its scan can
# restore the row of a backup whose manifest and artifacts are gone.
# ListedRestorable: every backup the catalog lists is restorable.
